# Template for dmoj/local_settings.py -- copy to dmoj/local_settings.py and fill in.
#
# The real file is gitignored and lives only on the server: it holds SECRET_KEY,
# the MariaDB password, the SMTP app password and the chat/event daemon keys.
# Every value below reading "CHANGEME" must be replaced with a real one.
#
# settings.py loads this file with exec(f.read(), globals()), so it runs inside the
# settings namespace: it can use += on lists defined earlier (INSTALLED_APPS,
# ALLOWED_HOSTS, STATICFILES_FINDERS) and mutate dicts such as WPADMIN in place.

